Copyright 2026 skoruba4j-is4-java contributors

This product includes software developed at:
- Spring Authorization Server / Spring Security (Apache-2.0) — protocol engine
- Nimbus JOSE+JWT (transitively, Apache-2.0) — JWT

Table and protocol semantics are aligned with IdentityServer4 (Apache-2.0 historically) and Skoruba IdentityServer4 Admin (MIT). This repository does not copy Skoruba Razor views or IdentityServer4 C# sources.

ASP.NET Core Identity password hash layout is documented by Microsoft; the Java encoder reimplements verification only.
